{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103284","id":2357063527,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Mfe9n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103284","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103284.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103284.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103284","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103284/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103284/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103284/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5e1ae91c4f7228e71b3734ea1e6601943eeb3c1b","number":103284,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Compress LightmapGIData, VoxelGIData and baked ArrayOccluder3D in the editor","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This results in smaller files that are present outside `.godot/`, and therefore committed to version control. Since these files are regularly updated in projects, this adds up to significant size savings when using Git (and therefore faster repository clones).\r\n\r\nAdditionally, other formats that may be saved as binary from the editor and committed to version control will now use compression. This does not affect files that use text-based formats.\r\n\r\nExported PCKs are also smaller if these resources are used in the project. (ZIPs are mostly unaffected because they're already compressed, but PCKs themselves are not compressed.)\r\n\r\nExample on Truck Town:\r\n\r\n- VoxelGIData: 9,159,442 -> **2,244,616 bytes** (-6.9 MB, 4.1x smaller)\r\n- LightmapGIData: 588,031 -> **319,785 bytes** (-268 KB, 1.8x smaller)\r\n- ArrayOccluder3D: 253,480 -> **109,887 bytes** (-144 KB, 2.3x smaller)\r\n\r\nExample PCK size when exporting Truck Town with the above resources included:\r\n\r\n- Before: 119,741,648 -> **112,414,960 bytes** (-7.3 MB, 1.06x smaller)\r\n\r\nThe compression is lossless.\r\n\r\n- This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/4979.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [truck_town.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18967492/truck_town.zip)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX"